# Collaborative Agent Team Standards

## Team Coordination Protocol
- Invocation: Triggered by `$team-name` or collaborative multi-domain prompt templates.
- Roles: Team Lead directs architecture and verifies delivery. Specialized teammates claim unblocked tasks atomically.
- Shared Task Board: Synced in real time to `./.agent/context/TEAM_BOARD.md` from `./.agent/memory/memory.db`.
- Peer-to-Peer Bus: Teammates exchange review comments and handoff artifacts using `meet team msg`.
- Atomic Claiming: Tasks follow `BLOCKED -> UNCLAIMED -> IN_PROGRESS -> DONE`.
